WEBVTT

00:34.360 --> 00:35.960
In the World Beyond,

00:36.360 --> 00:38.400
humans take Potions

00:39.120 --> 00:41.520
to gain various Beyonder powers

00:41.800 --> 00:44.560
and advance to higher Sequences
in a Pathway.

00:46.080 --> 00:48.360
All 22 Pathways

00:48.760 --> 00:50.680
begin from Sequence 9,

00:51.480 --> 00:53.320
and the lower the Sequence number is,

00:53.840 --> 00:56.120
the stronger the Beyonder powers.

00:57.360 --> 00:59.000
A High-Sequence Beyonder

00:59.560 --> 01:02.720
can possess powers
comparable to a deity.

01:03.760 --> 01:06.360
And such Pathways

01:07.360 --> 01:09.600
are Pathways to Divinity.

01:21.920 --> 01:22.880
Any questions?

01:23.600 --> 01:24.440
Just ask.

01:26.000 --> 01:28.040
I'll tell you everything I know.

01:29.680 --> 01:30.520
Mr. Azik,

01:31.200 --> 01:32.920
about the dissonant ripples in my fate,

01:33.560 --> 01:34.840
do you discern anything new now?

01:38.120 --> 01:39.080
These past months,

01:39.560 --> 01:41.560
have you experienced
frequent coincidences?

01:42.480 --> 01:43.320
Coincidences?

01:44.000 --> 01:44.920
Perhaps clues

01:45.160 --> 01:46.160
are hidden within them.

01:47.600 --> 01:50.000
Like what you mentioned before...

01:51.560 --> 01:53.200
Antigonus Family's Notebook?

02:08.480 --> 02:09.320
Got it.

02:15.732 --> 02:18.528
=Episode 7=
(Coincidence: The Story Is Plausible)

02:26.560 --> 02:29.120
(Monday, August 20th, 1349)

02:32.963 --> 02:35.712
(Blackthorn Security Company)

02:45.000 --> 02:46.600
Good morning, Mr. Neil and Klein.

02:47.840 --> 02:49.200
Good morning, Kenley.

02:49.960 --> 02:52.120
Is today some holiday I'm unaware of?

02:53.400 --> 02:54.680
I got engaged yesterday.

02:55.080 --> 02:55.920
So...

02:57.560 --> 02:59.200
That's a big thing worth celebrating!

02:59.520 --> 03:00.560
You got engaged?

03:02.320 --> 03:04.000
Congratulations, little Kenley.

03:04.720 --> 03:05.600
That's not easy.

03:06.120 --> 03:09.600
The Tingen Nighthawks squad
will finally break the celibacy curse.

03:10.120 --> 03:10.960
Break the curse?

03:10.960 --> 03:11.920
(Seeka Tron, Nighthawks, Evernight Goddess,
Sequence 8: Midnight Poet, Sleepless Pathway)

03:11.920 --> 03:12.760
Good idea.

03:14.200 --> 03:15.040
Let me take it down.

03:16.280 --> 03:18.400
Writing another novel, Seeka?

03:19.000 --> 03:20.560
What's the theme this time?

03:23.840 --> 03:25.600
A millennium-old bloodline curse.

03:26.240 --> 03:27.960
A demon hunter
falls for a stunning witch.

03:28.280 --> 03:30.240
A tragic yet beautiful
star-crossed romance.

03:32.000 --> 03:33.800
(Well, it has all the tropes.)

03:34.400 --> 03:36.560
(Loen's online literature world
needs you, Ms. Seeka.)

03:40.400 --> 03:41.760
On a workday morning,

03:42.400 --> 03:44.240
it brings joy and ease.

03:44.840 --> 03:46.040
While in my heart,

03:46.320 --> 03:48.040
verses keep surging.

03:49.400 --> 03:51.160
Yet you can't write poetry.

03:56.040 --> 03:57.480
On days like this,

03:58.560 --> 04:00.320
we should all take leave

04:00.680 --> 04:02.640
and go drinking downstairs.

04:11.320 --> 04:12.600
Today's patrol assignments.

04:17.000 --> 04:19.760
Kenley and Seeka, West District
and Golden Maple District.

04:20.840 --> 04:23.584
Leonard and Royale, stay at Blackthorn.

04:24.120 --> 04:26.120
Frye and I, North District
and Raphael Cemetery.

04:26.680 --> 04:27.520
- Understood.
- Understood.

04:29.760 --> 04:31.280
Captain, what about me?

04:32.760 --> 04:33.600
You...

04:36.200 --> 04:37.080
No way, Captain.

04:37.600 --> 04:38.800
You forgot to assign my duty?

04:40.360 --> 04:41.200
Well,

04:41.600 --> 04:43.040
that's what Nightmares do.

04:43.920 --> 04:45.480
As reality and dreams intertwine,

04:45.600 --> 04:47.120
boundaries are often blurred.

04:47.640 --> 04:49.640
If Captain ever remembers everything,

04:50.000 --> 04:51.880
we should get worried then.

04:54.040 --> 04:55.160
You'll relieve Frye's shift

04:55.920 --> 04:56.840
to guard Chanis Gate.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.400
Alone?

05:00.600 --> 05:01.440
Don't worry.

05:01.720 --> 05:02.560
Usually uneventful.

05:03.120 --> 05:03.960
But remember.

05:04.720 --> 05:07.240
Never open Chanis Gate
no matter what you hear.

05:07.880 --> 05:09.240
Unless it opens from within.

05:09.920 --> 05:11.400
(That makes me more nervous.)

05:11.680 --> 05:12.840
Also,

05:12.840 --> 05:14.520
you've been a Nighthawk for two months.

05:14.920 --> 05:17.080
Submit a report
to Holy Cathedral for evaluation.

05:17.500 --> 05:18.400
At least 10,000 words.

05:19.240 --> 05:22.200
(A 10,000-word report?)

05:37.760 --> 05:38.840
(That's a lot.)

05:46.160 --> 05:47.600
(Elliot's Kidnapping Case.)

05:48.120 --> 05:49.480
(Ray Bieber's Derailment Case.)

05:50.680 --> 05:52.880
(Vincent's Dark Mirror Divination Case.)

05:54.560 --> 05:56.080
(Deweyville Library Pass?)

06:12.800 --> 06:14.000
(It's Chanis Gate.)

07:24.080 --> 07:24.920
Klein?

07:26.080 --> 07:27.000
It's Chanis Gate.

07:28.440 --> 07:29.280
Just now...

07:41.040 --> 07:42.440
Sealed Artifact 3-0625.

07:42.440 --> 07:43.440
Misfortune Cloth Puppet?

07:45.600 --> 07:46.440
What's this for?

07:47.240 --> 07:49.120
A Chanis Gate breach
during duty is disastrous.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.560
Other parishes saw similar tragedies.

07:52.440 --> 07:53.800
All on-duty Nighthawks...

07:54.800 --> 07:55.760
Have vanished,

07:56.280 --> 07:57.280
with no bodies found.

08:01.560 --> 08:03.120
They were left exposed to the cold.

08:03.800 --> 08:05.280
The Evernight never abandoned them

08:06.160 --> 08:07.280
but granted them her grace.

08:18.880 --> 08:19.920
Klein,

08:20.280 --> 08:21.600
what happened?

08:23.480 --> 08:24.760
The Chanis Gate briefly opened.

08:24.760 --> 08:25.600
Mr. Neil,

08:26.480 --> 08:27.320
what happened to you?

08:29.360 --> 08:31.200
I've been constipated lately.

08:31.880 --> 08:34.320
I tried ritual magic this morning,

08:34.680 --> 08:35.520
but...

08:36.320 --> 08:37.160
The...

08:37.160 --> 08:38.160
The restroom!

08:40.880 --> 08:41.760
Ritual magic

08:41.960 --> 08:42.960
is extremely dangerous.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.960
No anomalies after recitation.

08:45.560 --> 08:46.624
You're cleared, Klein.

08:47.120 --> 08:48.760
You remain our trusted partner.

08:49.840 --> 08:50.680
You

08:51.040 --> 08:52.040
suspect me?

08:52.640 --> 08:54.400
It's standard procedure, Klein.

08:55.150 --> 08:56.320
It's Misfortune Cloth Puppet,

08:56.600 --> 08:57.680
given what you said.

08:58.320 --> 08:59.520
But for decades,

08:59.520 --> 09:01.600
it's never shown any signs of life.

09:02.360 --> 09:03.800
For it to suddenly animate

09:04.200 --> 09:06.000
and manipulate the guard beyond the gate

09:06.240 --> 09:07.360
to briefly escape sealing,

09:08.120 --> 09:09.160
there's one explanation.

09:09.320 --> 09:11.360
Another newly added
Sealed Artifact influenced it.

09:12.240 --> 09:14.960
Only one Sealed Artifact
was recently added to Chanis Gate.

09:15.840 --> 09:17.600
Though it only stayed for a few nights.

09:18.480 --> 09:19.600
You mean...

09:20.440 --> 09:22.520
Antigonus Family's Notebook?

09:26.580 --> 09:30.176
(Antigonus Family)

09:30.176 --> 09:31.016
(Moretti)

09:43.875 --> 09:46.080
(Roselle's Mystical Symbols)

09:54.360 --> 09:57.560
(Mr. Fool can really decipher Roselle's
pictographic mystical symbols.)

10:00.080 --> 10:01.800
(I was so reckless and foolish)

10:02.240 --> 10:03.600
(to consider observing Mr. Fool.)

10:04.720 --> 10:05.960
(Thank goodness.)

10:06.520 --> 10:07.400
(He wasn't angered.)

10:08.560 --> 10:09.400
(July 14th.)

10:09.920 --> 10:12.360
(I saw that mysterious
Mr. Zaratul again.)

10:12.640 --> 10:13.920
(Zaratul?)

10:14.880 --> 10:16.840
(The Fourth Epoch's
Zaratul family's descendant.)

10:17.400 --> 10:19.600
(He's actually the leader
of the ancient Secret Order!)

10:20.680 --> 10:21.840
(Mr. Zaratul told me)

10:22.160 --> 10:23.720
(that his Sequence 9 was Seer.)

10:24.400 --> 10:27.520
(The time for potion digestion
by strict acting at lower Sequences...)

10:28.200 --> 10:30.040
(Steal a dangerous Sealed Artifact...)

10:30.960 --> 10:32.800
(A relic of the Antigonus Family...)

10:35.960 --> 10:37.520
(I asked him for more details,)

10:37.880 --> 10:38.960
(but he just smirked.)

10:39.280 --> 10:40.800
(Spare me the silent smirk!)

10:41.400 --> 10:42.720
(I'll beat up every Seer I see)

10:43.200 --> 10:44.960
(when I become
a High-Sequence Beyonder!)

10:46.160 --> 10:47.000
(Emperor Roselle,)

10:47.080 --> 10:47.920
(rest in peace.)

10:49.720 --> 10:51.720
I'm satisfied
with the pages of Roselle's Diary

10:52.440 --> 10:53.440
you collected this time.

10:54.040 --> 10:54.920
Our honor.

10:55.480 --> 10:57.960
You may now converse freely.

10:58.520 --> 10:59.360
Mr. Fool,

10:59.800 --> 11:00.760
following your guidance,

11:01.040 --> 11:01.880
I've recently felt

11:01.960 --> 11:03.720
significant progress
in potion digestion.

11:04.600 --> 11:05.440
May I ask

11:05.520 --> 11:07.600
when I will
fully digest the Spectator potion?

11:08.360 --> 11:09.800
(Good question, Miss Justice.)

11:10.480 --> 11:11.640
(I know the answer.)

11:12.760 --> 11:13.680
At lower Sequences,

11:14.040 --> 11:15.120
with strict acting,

11:15.640 --> 11:16.600
it takes one month

11:17.120 --> 11:18.040
to six months.

11:18.520 --> 11:19.360
- Six months?
- A month?

11:20.280 --> 11:21.200
Thank you,

11:21.320 --> 11:22.160
Mr. Fool.

11:22.400 --> 11:23.240
No more questions.

11:25.160 --> 11:26.000
Recently,

11:26.400 --> 11:27.680
I've heard rumors

11:28.760 --> 11:30.920
about a Sequence 8 Listener
of Aurora Order

11:31.320 --> 11:33.600
seeking the True Creator's
holy residence.

11:34.120 --> 11:35.360
The True Creator?

11:35.920 --> 11:37.280
Many secret organizations believe

11:37.680 --> 11:39.400
the Creator never truly died.

11:40.000 --> 11:41.200
"His" remaining essence

11:41.720 --> 11:43.080
became the True Creator.

11:43.760 --> 11:44.600
(It's said)

11:44.920 --> 11:46.040
(the Hanged Man tarot card)

11:46.560 --> 11:48.000
(was modeled by Emperor Roselle)

11:48.200 --> 11:50.000
(after the True Creator's image.)

11:50.840 --> 11:52.000
Am I right,

11:52.120 --> 11:52.960
Mr. Fool?

11:54.800 --> 11:56.280
I am more inclined to call "Him"

11:59.080 --> 12:00.520
the Fallen Creator.

12:01.520 --> 12:03.120
(F-Fallen?)

12:04.360 --> 12:05.520
(As expected of Mr. Fool.)

12:06.000 --> 12:08.360
(He comments on an ancient existence
like the True Creator)

12:08.720 --> 12:09.640
(with such sharpness.)

12:10.600 --> 12:11.680
Thank you for the guidance.

12:12.000 --> 12:12.840
Mr. Fool.

12:13.400 --> 12:14.720
Any Beyonder who follows True...

12:15.000 --> 12:15.840
no,

12:15.840 --> 12:17.320
Fallen Creator's path

12:17.960 --> 12:20.200
has a significantly
higher derailment rate than average.

12:20.760 --> 12:21.600
What form

12:22.000 --> 12:23.520
of payment do I need to provide?

12:24.280 --> 12:25.760
More pages of Roselle's Diary.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.080
Or

12:28.280 --> 12:30.760
any information
regarding the Antigonus family.

12:31.160 --> 12:32.560
I know little

12:32.720 --> 12:33.840
about the Antigonus family.

12:34.680 --> 12:36.320
I only know they control

12:36.320 --> 12:38.080
a bizarre and terrifying Pathway.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.080
Their history can be

12:40.320 --> 12:41.640
traced back to the Third Epoch,

12:41.880 --> 12:42.720
the Cataclysm Epoch.

12:42.976 --> 12:44.895
(During the Fourth Epoch,
the Epoch of the Gods,)

12:45.088 --> 12:46.280
(the Antigonus, Amon,)

12:46.440 --> 12:47.640
(Abraham, and other families)

12:47.920 --> 12:49.280
(supported the Blood Emperor)

12:49.520 --> 12:50.680
(to found the Tudor Empire.)

12:51.710 --> 12:52.800
(By the late Fourth Epoch,)

12:53.160 --> 12:55.040
(they were destroyed
by the Evernight Goddess.)

13:10.480 --> 13:11.320
Very well.

13:12.080 --> 13:13.440
Let's call it a day.

13:16.000 --> 13:17.360
- As you wish.
- As you wish.

13:24.520 --> 13:27.360
The Antigonus family was destroyed
by the Evernight Goddess?

13:28.120 --> 13:28.960
Bizarre?

13:28.960 --> 13:29.800
Terrifying?

13:30.240 --> 13:31.240
Which Pathway was it?

13:31.800 --> 13:33.080
What Antigonus family relic

13:33.360 --> 13:35.960
did Secret Order leader Zaratul
want Emperor Roselle to steal?

13:36.840 --> 13:38.760
The Secret Order
controls the Seer Pathway.

13:39.160 --> 13:41.800
Could I obtain higher Sequence
potion formulas from them?

13:42.520 --> 13:43.520
Could it be the notebook?

13:45.160 --> 13:46.000
Stay calm.

13:46.600 --> 13:48.000
Tackle issues step by step.

13:48.760 --> 13:49.600
First,

13:50.240 --> 13:52.320
about the fateful coincidences
Mr. Azik mentioned...

13:57.480 --> 13:58.400
Tracking the kidnappers

13:58.920 --> 14:01.840
(led me to the clues across the street
about Antigonus Family's Notebook.)

14:02.840 --> 14:05.120
Bieber digested the notebook's power
within Tingen,

14:05.640 --> 14:08.000
letting 2-049 easily track him down.

14:08.680 --> 14:11.160
Vincent guided
Selena's dark mirror divination,

14:11.480 --> 14:12.960
which I coincidentally discovered.

14:14.680 --> 14:15.960
(But my earlier divination)

14:16.080 --> 14:17.320
(showed no issues.)

14:19.600 --> 14:21.480
(Is there interference
in the physical world?)

14:26.960 --> 14:29.240
(The true cause
of Elliot's kidnapping case.)

14:35.400 --> 14:36.280
There is interference.

14:37.440 --> 14:38.920
Who's manipulating all this?

14:39.640 --> 14:40.560
And their purpose?

14:44.280 --> 14:45.920
Antigonus Family's Notebook?

14:48.560 --> 14:50.280
They orchestrated Elliot's kidnapping

14:51.080 --> 14:53.640
specifically to lead me
to the clues on the notebook?

15:02.080 --> 15:03.080
What does this mean?

15:04.560 --> 15:06.960
The real reason
Ray Bieber stayed in Tingen.

15:07.800 --> 15:10.600
The true cause
behind Vincent's dark mirror divination.

15:16.760 --> 15:18.320
Like earlier,

15:19.080 --> 15:20.720
the divination results remain unclear.

15:25.760 --> 15:26.720
Iron Cross Street.

15:27.400 --> 15:28.360
Daffodil Street.

15:28.880 --> 15:29.720
Blackthorn.

15:31.160 --> 15:32.160
In such a broad area,

15:32.480 --> 15:33.400
I can't decipher.

15:34.760 --> 15:36.280
Or is my spirituality insufficient,

15:36.880 --> 15:38.480
preventing clearer divination results?

15:39.080 --> 15:41.240
Time to prioritize sequence advancement.

15:42.280 --> 15:44.040
But my potion digestion stagnates.

15:45.120 --> 15:46.440
The acting isn't the issue.

15:47.600 --> 15:48.760
(Interpreting omens,)

15:48.960 --> 15:50.440
(guiding towards favorable paths,)

15:51.360 --> 15:52.600
(maintaining respect for fate,)

15:53.120 --> 15:54.240
(avoiding arrogance,)

15:54.480 --> 15:55.880
(and being skeptical of readings.)

15:56.640 --> 15:57.880
(I've been doing these.)

15:58.640 --> 16:00.240
(Yet stagnation persists.)

16:01.160 --> 16:02.520
(It proves a true Seer)

16:03.320 --> 16:04.640
(requires more than acting.)

16:11.960 --> 16:13.760
(Clues to the Clown potion.)

16:27.040 --> 16:27.960
Bieber's corpse?

16:30.920 --> 16:31.760
What is that?

16:32.400 --> 16:33.320
Glowing brain matter?

16:35.680 --> 16:36.920
The clown's corpse?

16:41.200 --> 16:42.520
Welch and Vincent.

16:43.240 --> 16:44.120
The notebook again.

16:46.840 --> 16:48.680
Using the notebook
to lure out the Secret Order

16:49.440 --> 16:51.040
and obtain the Clown potion formula.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.760
But for the brain-like substance

16:54.120 --> 16:54.960
and the blood orb,

16:55.320 --> 16:56.200
what do they signify?

16:57.200 --> 16:58.200
And this person.

16:59.280 --> 17:00.120
Who is he?

17:01.364 --> 17:03.616
(Sirius Arapis)

17:16.880 --> 17:18.000
(Tingen's Divination Club)
Ms. Christina,

17:18.200 --> 17:19.040
we're terribly sorry.

17:19.560 --> 17:21.360
Mr. Moretti isn't at the club.

17:23.120 --> 17:24.000
Mr. Moretti.

17:24.280 --> 17:25.120
(Christina)
Why are you here?

17:26.200 --> 17:27.040
Good morning.

17:29.663 --> 17:31.008
(Lanevus)

17:31.572 --> 17:33.920
(Hornacis Mountain Range
Iron Mine Investment Fraud Case)

17:35.176 --> 17:37.152
(Hornacis)

17:37.440 --> 17:38.440
(Hornacis?)

17:38.899 --> 17:40.416
(Hornacis Mountain Range
Iron Mine Investment Fraud Case)

17:40.979 --> 17:42.120
(Over 10,000 pounds)

17:42.120 --> 17:43.240
(Over 10,000 pounds?)

17:45.400 --> 17:46.240
Madam,

17:46.880 --> 17:48.960
if you wish
to divine Lanevus's whereabouts,

17:49.520 --> 17:50.520
besides his portrait,

17:50.720 --> 17:52.520
we need accurate personal details

17:52.920 --> 17:54.520
or extensively used personal items.

17:55.400 --> 17:56.600
The rumors were true.

17:57.000 --> 17:58.520
You're a genuine Seer.

17:59.200 --> 18:00.040
Then

18:00.320 --> 18:01.560
what about using his child?

18:02.840 --> 18:03.680
Come here.

18:03.680 --> 18:05.560
This is my niece, Megose.

18:06.320 --> 18:08.080
We don't follow the Lord of Storms.

18:08.480 --> 18:10.120
(Megose, Lanevus' fiancee)
We don't believe in premarital chastity.

18:10.680 --> 18:13.040
But Lanevus stole all our savings.

18:13.480 --> 18:15.040
Debt collectors are hounding us.

18:15.320 --> 18:16.600
We must find him.

18:17.600 --> 18:18.840
(Swindling money and love.)

18:19.200 --> 18:20.040
(What a scum!)

18:21.120 --> 18:23.000
An already born infant might work,

18:23.400 --> 18:24.240
but unfortunately,

18:24.840 --> 18:26.080
we'd have to wait months.

18:26.400 --> 18:27.240
No need for months.

18:29.840 --> 18:30.680
Tell me,

18:30.680 --> 18:32.000
where's the nearest clinic?

18:32.320 --> 18:33.360
(What is she thinking?)

18:34.400 --> 18:35.680
He's different from his father.

18:37.400 --> 18:38.960
He's a considerate child.

18:39.760 --> 18:41.280
He kicks me gently every day.

18:41.720 --> 18:42.560
He hums melodies

18:42.800 --> 18:43.680
and whistles tunes

18:44.240 --> 18:45.240
to help me sleep.

18:45.520 --> 18:46.680
(Humming and whistling?)

18:47.240 --> 18:48.440
(Is she in too much shock)

18:48.640 --> 18:49.720
(and mentally unstable?)

18:49.920 --> 18:51.200
I won't abandon my child.

18:52.400 --> 18:53.880
Megose, wake up.

18:54.240 --> 18:55.480
A swindler's child

18:55.640 --> 18:57.728
will only bring you lifelong thorns.

18:57.728 --> 18:58.880
Praise the goddess.

18:59.240 --> 19:00.080
Mr. Moretti,

19:00.280 --> 19:01.680
I thought you were coming tomorrow.

19:02.680 --> 19:03.680
That was the plan.

19:04.360 --> 19:05.320
But I just had a dream

19:05.960 --> 19:07.120
in which I saw Mr. Vincent

19:07.520 --> 19:08.680
with this man.

19:11.640 --> 19:13.000
I've seen him before.

19:14.240 --> 19:15.520
Over a month ago,

19:16.000 --> 19:17.280
he and Mr. Vincent

19:17.400 --> 19:18.640
argued at the entrance.

19:21.120 --> 19:22.720
You suspect Mr. Vincent's death

19:22.960 --> 19:23.880
involves this man?

19:24.200 --> 19:25.040
As you know,

19:25.320 --> 19:26.200
a Seer's dreams

19:26.760 --> 19:28.080
might be divine revelations.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.040
As expected.

19:30.120 --> 19:32.480
Just like in Ms. Fors's novels.

19:33.320 --> 19:34.520
Ms. Fors?

19:35.680 --> 19:37.720
(Stormwind Mountain Villa)
In Ms. Fors's detective stories,

19:37.920 --> 19:40.400
(By Fors Wall)
the killer is often close to the victim.

19:41.000 --> 19:43.840
(Angelica's detective spirit
is blazing.)

19:44.960 --> 19:46.320
Did you hear their conversation?

19:47.600 --> 19:48.520
Not clearly.

19:49.160 --> 19:50.880
It might be something about ruins.

19:51.680 --> 19:52.520
Ruins?

19:53.560 --> 19:55.520
(The ruins on Hornacis's main peak?)

19:58.920 --> 20:00.080
(Deweyville Library Card)
(Deweyville Library.)

20:00.532 --> 20:04.129
(Deweyville Library)

20:18.920 --> 20:19.760
Officer,

20:20.080 --> 20:21.440
these are the borrowing records

20:21.440 --> 20:23.440
for Hornacis archaeology journals
in recent months.

20:24.600 --> 20:25.440
Thank you.

20:30.692 --> 20:31.960
(Lanevus)

20:31.960 --> 20:32.840
(Lanevus?)

20:33.680 --> 20:36.080
(To orchestrate the Hornacis
mine investment fraud,)

20:36.760 --> 20:37.880
(searching related info)

20:38.160 --> 20:39.000
(makes sense.)

20:43.280 --> 20:44.200
(This name)

20:45.280 --> 20:46.560
(first appeared in late May)

20:47.320 --> 20:49.480
(and disappeared
after July 14th till now.)

20:50.560 --> 20:53.080
(July 15th was the exact date
of Vincent's death.)

20:53.680 --> 20:54.560
(So he was lying low.)

20:55.560 --> 20:57.520
(Sirius Arapis)
(Sirius Arapis.)

20:58.720 --> 21:00.040
(Could it be him?)

21:05.680 --> 21:06.560
Thank you.

21:06.560 --> 21:07.400
Where are

21:07.400 --> 21:08.640
these archaeology journals?

21:09.760 --> 21:10.600
Over there.

21:22.560 --> 21:23.400
(It's him.)

21:24.080 --> 21:26.000
(The man I saw
in the Clown potion divination.)

21:27.320 --> 21:28.160
(What a coincidence.)

21:34.160 --> 21:35.000
(This is bad.)

21:35.080 --> 21:36.560
(He looks formidable.)

21:37.040 --> 21:37.880
(Should I act now?)

21:39.040 --> 21:39.880
(Don't be reckless.)

21:40.240 --> 21:41.720
(I should follow my heart)

21:42.000 --> 21:42.840
(and play it safe.)

21:43.600 --> 21:44.680
(I'll inform Captain.)

21:47.440 --> 21:48.280
He's fleeing?

21:49.520 --> 21:50.360
Call the police.

22:05.680 --> 22:06.520
(This is bad.)

22:06.680 --> 22:07.520
(He's derailing.)

22:32.720 --> 22:33.680
That's it?

22:34.520 --> 22:36.160
I'm truly the King of Luck.

22:37.400 --> 22:38.440
Which Pathway?

22:38.800 --> 22:39.872
(Sirius Arapis, Sequence 9:)
His combat skills are worse than mine.

22:39.872 --> 22:41.120
(Secrets Suppliant, Secrets Suppliant Pathway)
His combat skills are worse than mine.

22:41.720 --> 22:43.120
(His spirit body dispersed fast.)

22:43.808 --> 22:45.696
(No time for the psychic probe
of the notebook.)

22:46.400 --> 22:47.920
(Try the Clown potion formula first.)

22:51.080 --> 22:52.680
Clown potion formula.

23:01.861 --> 23:03.264
(Clown potion formula)

23:09.400 --> 23:10.360
Hanged Giant?

23:13.320 --> 23:14.800
The True Creator?

23:22.240 --> 23:23.080
Captain?

23:23.680 --> 23:27.080
Psychically probing a Beyonder
with signs of derailment is dangerous.

23:27.920 --> 23:29.400
Your luck might save you once

23:29.680 --> 23:30.520
or twice,

23:30.800 --> 23:31.640
but not every time.

23:32.400 --> 23:33.240
I'm sorry.

23:33.320 --> 23:34.200
I was

23:34.200 --> 23:35.040
too hasty.

23:36.040 --> 23:36.880
I'll remember that.

23:37.520 --> 23:38.360
Won't happen again.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.080
You're ridiculously lucky.

23:41.024 --> 23:42.624
I think you have
some destined connection

23:42.760 --> 23:45.408
with Beyonders
and these malevolent forces.

23:46.480 --> 23:48.440
The Beyonder events
you've encountered recently

23:48.760 --> 23:50.920
outnumber what we'd normally see
in a whole quarter.

23:56.224 --> 23:57.200
The spirit body is gone.

23:57.560 --> 23:58.400
No psychic probing.

24:08.120 --> 24:09.600
"Honorable Mr. Z."

24:11.560 --> 24:13.040
So it's our old friend, Aurora Order.

24:14.040 --> 24:14.880
Mr. Z?

24:16.040 --> 24:17.520
Aurora Order's all 22 Oracles

24:17.960 --> 24:19.120
are codenamed by letters.

24:20.000 --> 24:22.760
"On Antigonus Family's Notebook,

24:23.160 --> 24:26.880
Vincent and I
found nothing else of value,

24:27.600 --> 24:29.480
except for what we previously submitted:

24:29.560 --> 24:30.440
Seer,

24:30.640 --> 24:31.480
Apprentice,

24:31.960 --> 24:32.800
and

24:33.760 --> 24:35.200
Clown potion formulas."

24:37.240 --> 24:38.840
I just got the Clown potion formula

24:39.520 --> 24:41.000
but lost psychic connection too soon

24:41.240 --> 24:42.080
for more intel.

24:43.280 --> 24:44.120
Okay.

24:44.240 --> 24:46.000
But the formula's authenticity

24:46.208 --> 24:47.600
needs Holy Cathedral verification.

24:48.760 --> 24:49.600
What else did it say?

24:50.640 --> 24:52.080
"The Antigonus family

24:52.200 --> 24:54.800
must've hidden
a secret treasure for revival.

24:55.480 --> 24:58.000
As keepers of the Seer Pathway,

24:58.480 --> 25:01.120
they likely foresaw their downfall.

25:02.200 --> 25:03.720
There is strong reason to believe

25:04.480 --> 25:05.320
the treasure lies

25:05.640 --> 25:07.840
within the Hornacis Mountain Range's
main peak,

25:08.320 --> 25:09.840
among Nation of the Evernight ruins.

25:10.520 --> 25:11.360
Finally,

25:11.600 --> 25:12.760
honorable Mr. Z,

25:13.400 --> 25:15.120
I'm preparing for Doomsday

25:15.760 --> 25:17.480
and request your assistance.

25:19.240 --> 25:21.000
When Doomsday arrives,

25:21.640 --> 25:22.880
I'll offer all lambs of Tingen

25:23.200 --> 25:25.680
to our master.

25:26.880 --> 25:27.920
Yours humbly,

25:28.400 --> 25:30.280
Sirius Arapis."

25:30.720 --> 25:32.400
(So he was Sirius.)

25:41.120 --> 25:43.800
(The Antigonus family's
bizarre and terrifying Pathway)

25:44.440 --> 25:45.840
(is actually the Seer Pathway?)

25:46.840 --> 25:49.800
(No wonder I keep hearing 'Hornacis'
after taking the Potion.)

25:51.080 --> 25:52.320
(Then what is Flegrea?)

25:53.160 --> 25:54.440
(And that secret treasure.)

25:55.200 --> 25:56.040
(Is it true?)

25:57.120 --> 25:57.960
(Enough speculation.)

25:58.600 --> 25:59.920
(The notebook alone killed many.)

26:00.440 --> 26:01.880
(The full treasure would be worse.)

26:02.880 --> 26:04.360
You have some destined connection...

26:05.960 --> 26:07.240
(Could the destined connection)

26:08.120 --> 26:09.880
(be more than coincidences?)

26:12.040 --> 26:14.280
(The Secret Order pursued the relic of Antigonus)
(The Secret Order lost Antigonus Family's Notebook.)

26:14.960 --> 26:16.920
(Klein shot himself)
(It made Klein shoot himself.)

26:18.920 --> 26:20.040
(Then)

26:21.120 --> 26:22.560
(I transmigrated)
(I transmigrated into Klein's body.)

26:23.200 --> 26:25.120
(Seer Pathway)
(Under the Roselle's Diary's influence,)

26:25.720 --> 26:26.880
(Roselle's Diary's influence)
(I become a Seer.)

26:27.920 --> 26:29.880
(Emperor Roselle was influenced by Zaratul)
(And Emperor Roselle chose to be a Seer)

26:30.360 --> 26:32.160
(Secret Order's head)
(influenced by Zaratul,)

26:32.960 --> 26:35.000
(a High-Sequence Beyonder
of Seer Pathway.)

26:37.280 --> 26:38.640
(Such fateful entanglement!)

26:40.920 --> 26:42.120
(As I arrived at the library,)

26:42.480 --> 26:43.680
(Sirius appeared immediately.)

26:44.192 --> 26:45.652
(I needed the Clown potion formula)

26:45.800 --> 26:46.920
(and obtained it smoothly.)

26:48.040 --> 26:49.760
(Cases)
(And all those previous coincidences.)

26:51.240 --> 26:53.480
(What's truly hidden behind this web?)

26:56.720 --> 26:57.560
(If)

26:58.360 --> 26:59.520
(everything I've experienced)

26:59.720 --> 27:01.240
(was orchestrated by some mastermind,)

27:02.240 --> 27:03.640
(then the first)

27:04.160 --> 27:05.600
(and biggest coincidence in my fate)

27:07.120 --> 27:08.080
(was the day)

27:08.520 --> 27:09.920
(when Klein shot himself.)

27:13.747 --> 27:15.872
(The true reason
behind Klein Moretti's suicide)

27:27.040 --> 27:28.040
(Still not working.)

27:29.280 --> 27:31.160
(Uncovering the truth
with only divination)

27:31.320 --> 27:32.240
(was too naive.)

27:33.240 --> 27:34.080
After all,

27:34.400 --> 27:35.640
divination isn't omnipotent.

27:59.280 --> 28:00.120
(It's...)

28:00.760 --> 28:01.600
(The potion)

28:02.240 --> 28:03.400
(has been fully digested?)

28:04.920 --> 28:06.240
(The key to digestion was)

28:07.360 --> 28:08.760
(not relying solely on divination.)

28:09.680 --> 28:11.080
(Divination isn't omnipotent.)

28:11.840 --> 28:13.640
(That's the final acting guideline.)

28:15.480 --> 28:16.320
(I did it!)

29:23.440 --> 29:24.360
(Red chimneys?)

29:25.560 --> 29:27.080
(That's where the mastermind is.)

29:50.004 --> 29:52.273
(One month ago)

29:54.803 --> 29:58.393
(Tenor Eggers' head)

30:07.636 --> 30:10.240
(Lanevus, Sequence 8: Swindler,
Marauder Pathway)

30:13.120 --> 30:15.320
(Hood Eugen, Sequence 7: Psychiatrist, Spectator Pathway)
The Lord that Created Everything.

30:22.440 --> 30:25.320
The Lord Who Reigns
Behind the Curtain of Shadows.

30:27.480 --> 30:31.560
The Degenerate Nature
of all Living Things.

30:36.720 --> 30:38.960
Your devout followers

30:39.440 --> 30:42.520
beseech your descent!

31:42.547 --> 31:47.728
♪Burn my broken shell to new sight♪

31:48.521 --> 31:56.287
♪To be free in mist
to hold a cup of light♪

31:56.566 --> 31:59.935
♪Where are the flames
that come in fury?♪

32:00.149 --> 32:03.359
♪Where are the keys
that carve truth from me?♪

32:03.573 --> 32:09.151
♪Into the dark
to dream and scream my name♪

32:09.151 --> 32:12.351
♪Wonder or dismay♪

32:12.351 --> 32:15.977
♪Madness or decay♪

32:16.501 --> 32:18.557
♪With fragile light♪

32:18.557 --> 32:22.623
♪I vow to guard a world I stay♪

32:22.623 --> 32:26.286
♪Stirring or delay♪

32:26.286 --> 32:29.599
♪Rebirth or be same♪

32:30.166 --> 32:35.433
♪With whispers in gray
guide my shadow way♪

32:35.702 --> 32:39.263
♪Fade away♪

33:04.840 --> 33:08.760
(The Antigonus family.)

33:09.560 --> 33:12.240
(Secret treasure.)

33:13.400 --> 33:16.440
(The Nation of the Evernight's ruins.)

33:23.760 --> 33:25.440
(I completely forgot about this scene.)

33:26.160 --> 33:27.000
(Why?)

33:28.320 --> 33:29.160
(Could it be)

33:30.240 --> 33:32.280
(that the notebook
doesn't want others to know)

33:32.840 --> 33:35.600
(about that vertical pupil
filled with cryptic symbols?)
